The current internal Adaptec source tree has some corner case stability
issues.

1) 2.4 based bigmem systems panic during initialization
2) certain machines lock up under heavy load, the original tree for the
legacy kernels does not.

The second issue has blocked me generating a patch to the 2.6 tree for
inclusion. Several external users of this code tree are not experiencing the
lock up conditions. I would be interested in any code inspection or bug
reports against this driver.

Sincerely -- Mark Salyzyn

-----Original Message-----
From: linux-scsi-owner@vger.kernel.org
